WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.206
Flips terminate on every fourfold.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.104
The minimal model program simplifies a variety by a sequence of flips.

3
00:00:07.254 --> 00:00:10.379
Must every sequence stop? Open past dimension three.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.864
Claimed: every log canonical sequence of flips stops on fourfolds.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.280
Manuscript only, not in Lean.
